{
  "id": "013",
  "title": "Hotel Introduction",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2015-11-13",
  "synopsis": "Do you plan a vacation in China and need a hotel? In this lesson we take a look at one hotel’s introduction, and learn new relevant words.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/14/e71b1dd73fcbe76dd426ac9543ac1554c00ecb39.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "宾馆介绍\n\n    大家好。下面向大家介绍一下我们宾馆。我们宾馆在火车站附近，有很多房间。宾馆的左边有一个饭店，右边有一个商场。另外，宾馆离公共汽车站很近，有到各个旅游景点、机场的公共汽车。欢迎大家入住我们的宾馆。",
    "traditional": "賓館介紹\n\n    大家好。下面向大家介紹一下我們賓館。我們賓館在火車站附近，有很多房間。賓館的左邊有一個飯店，右邊有一個商場。另外，賓館離公共汽車站很近，有到各個旅遊景點、機場的公共汽車。歡迎大家入住我們的賓館。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Hotel Introduction"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "大家好。",
      "traditional": "大家好。",
      "pinyin": "dà jiā hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "下面向大家介绍一下我们宾馆。",
      "traditional": "下面向大家介紹一下我們賓館。",
      "pinyin": "xià miàn xiàng dà jiā jiè shào yí xià wǒ men bīn guǎn",
      "english": "Hello everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我们宾馆在火车站附近，有很多房间。",
      "traditional": "我們賓館在火車站附近，有很多房間。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men bīn guǎn zài huǒ chē zhàn fù jìn yǒu hěn duō fáng jiān",
      "english": "The following is an introduction to our hotel for everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "宾馆的左边有一个饭店，右边有一个商场。",
      "traditional": "賓館的左邊有一個飯店，右邊有一個商場。",
      "pinyin": "bīn guǎn de zuǒ bian yǒu yí ge fàn diàn yòu bian yǒu yí ge shāng chǎng",
      "english": "Our hotel is close to the train station, and has lots of rooms."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "另外，宾馆离公共汽车站很近，",
      "traditional": "另外，賓館離公共汽車站很近，",
      "pinyin": "lìng wài bīn guǎn lí gōng gòng qì chē zhàn hěn jìn",
      "english": "To the left of the hotel there is a restaurant, and on the right side there is a shopping mall."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "有到各个旅游景点、机场的公共汽车。",
      "traditional": "有到各個旅遊景點、機場的公共汽車。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu dào gè gè lǚ yóu jǐng diǎn jī chǎng de gōng gòng qì chē",
      "english": "Furthermore, the hotel is very close to a public bus stop, ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "欢迎大家入住我们的宾馆。",
      "traditional": "歡迎大家入住我們的賓館。",
      "pinyin": "huān yíng dà jiā rù zhù wǒ men de bīn guǎn",
      "english": "... which has public busses to all the tourist spots and the airport."
    }
  ],
